[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Third silence: First and second silence: repeat the question shorter. Third silence: say the silence sentence and end the call, no main menu.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Out-of-scope question: Ask whether the caller wants the main menu instead of sending them there directly; yes -> main menu, continue -> resume the flow, unclear -> three tries.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Angry caller: Up to three calming replies, then transfer to an agent; insults are never answered.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Two cards with the same last four digits: Ask the last six digits, and only if those match too, the card number.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Card number in speech: Never say more than the last four digits, whatever the service returns (masked in test, full in production).
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Currency names: Always the full names Türk Lirası, Dolar, Euro, İngiliz Sterlini; the codes in the analysis sentences are replaced.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Statement week change limit: Once per calendar year; the limit sentence is optional; the monthly and three-per-year limits are not used.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION E-mail address for the statement: Only the address registered at the bank; never an address the caller gives; only the latest statement.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Identity check: No second factor or any code is asked.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Payments and how to pay: No payment and no explanation of payment channels; transfer to an agent with the payment sentence.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Service failure versus no card: The card list 404 FB_IVR_CHANNEL_102 is the no-eligible-card case (main menu); any other service error or timeout goes to an agent, never the main menu.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Order after the reading: With more than one card the other-card question comes before the offer; the e-mail lookup runs before the offer.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Joint statement notice: The sentence that the other card is affected is said before the confirmation question.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Main menu sentences: Normal end: "Sizi ana menüye yönlendiriyorum."; three tries used up, no eligible card and non-Turkish use "aktarıyorum".
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Earlier statement or other address requested: Say only the latest statement / only the registered address is possible and offer to send that; do not end the call at once.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] DECISION Someone else's card: Say that for security reasons only the caller's own cards can be handled, give no information, and end with routing to the main menu.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION No service tells whether the yearly statement week right is already used (contract 5.3, open point 3). The change is offered to everyone; a failing change goes to an agent with the statement week sentence.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION Client timeout for a slow service is not agreed (contract section 7, analysis 11.2). 25 seconds is used because answers can take more than ten seconds and still succeed; no call is retried.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION Which currencyType statement.pdf.send gets is not decided anywhere. The fixed value TL from the contract example is sent.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION The request field call.ani (caller's number) has no call variable; it is sent empty. The contract says nothing depends on it.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION The sentence for foreign currency debt moved into Turkish Lira (transferAmount above zero) was never drafted (analysis 11.4). A plain sentence naming the currency is said before the Turkish Lira figures.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION No-statement-debt reading: whether the offer is made and whether foreign future totals are read is not agreed (analysis 4.7). No offer is made, only the Turkish Lira total is read, and a total that is zero or negative is left out.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION How a card with no statement yet is recognised in the balance answer is not documented. A missing statementDate is treated as that case.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION Cut-day and after-due-date readings have no fixed Turkish sentences beyond the cut-day example, and it is not said which totals are read. Only the Turkish Lira total debt is read.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION When an e-mail address counts as long or messy is not defined (Selin was checking with Elçin). Addresses with digits, hyphens or more than one dot before the at sign are shortened.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION For a third-party request the mails say back to the IVR login step, the example says main menu; no closing sentence is fixed. The ending wording is composed from Burcu's description.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION Silence timing (seconds) was left for later; the platform default applies.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION A customer whose only card has isMainCard false is treated as having no eligible card; the documents only describe the case where other cards exist.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION Production cards.list returns full card numbers; with masked test data the last-six step often cannot separate two cards, so the agent goes on to the card number question.
[2026-10-11T19:27:29Z + 581.1s] QUESTION contact.email.get failing after the balance succeeded: the documents only say agent. The debt is read first, then the caller is transferred.
